<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>We Do Care Global — Published Projects</title>
<style>
:root{--bg:#0a0b10;--card:#14161f;--border:#232635;--text:#e8eaf2;--muted:#8b90a6;--gold:#d9a95f}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",system-ui,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);line-height:1.6}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(10,11,16,.9);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:16px 24px}
.nav-inner{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}
.hero{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:100px 24px 60px;text-align:center}
.hero h1{font-family:"Instrument Serif",Georgia,serif;font-size:3.4rem;font-weight:400;color:var(--gold);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.05}
.hero p{font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--muted);max-width:640px;margin:16px auto 0}
.cards{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:24px}
.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:16px;padding:32px;transition:transform .15s,border-color .15s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--gold)}
.card h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px}
.card p{color:var(--muted);font-size:.95rem}
.section{max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:60px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--border)}
.footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:40px 24px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav><div style="text-align:center;padding:10px 0"><img src="assets/logo.jpg" alt="Logo" style="width:100px;border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(217,169,95,.4)"></div><div class="nav-inner"><a href="#" style="font-weight:700;font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--text)">We Do Care Global</a><div><a href="#published" style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-right:16px">Published</a><a href="#about" style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-right:16px">About</a><a href="#contact" style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)">Contact</a></div></div></nav>
<header class="hero" id="top">
<h1>We Do Care Global</h1>
<p>Published projects — autonomous AI governance, production RAG, and continuously-archived research infrastructure.</p>
<p style="font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px">Emir Perla · AI Workflow &amp; Automation — Sarajevo — <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8515-2727" style="color:var(--gold)">ORCID 0009-0009-8515-2727</a></p>
</header>
<main id="published" class="cards">
<div class="card"><h3><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/agentguard" style="color:#ff4d4d">AgentGuard</a></h3><p>Agent security &amp; governance control plane — policy engine, audit log, approval queue, kill switch.</p><span style="font-size:.75rem;background:#232635;color:var(--muted);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px">v0.1.0 · DOI pending · <a href="https://we-do-care-global.github.io/agentguard/" style="color:var(--gold)">Live page →</a></span></div>
<div class="card"><h3><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/enterprise-hybrid-rag" style="color:#00b4d8">Enterprise Hybrid-RAG</a></h3><p>Production RAG with NVIDIA NeMo retrieval + evaluation layer.</p><span style="font-size:.75rem;background:#232635;color:var(--muted);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px">v0.1.0 · DOI pending · <a href="https://we-do-care-global.github.io/enterprise-hybrid-rag/" style="color:var(--gold)">Live page →</a></span></div>
<div class="card"><h3><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/agent-eval" style="color:#9d4edd">Agent Eval</a></h3><p>Agent evaluation and observability platform.</p><span style="font-size:.75rem;background:#232635;color:var(--muted);padding:3px 8px;border-radius:6px">v0.1.0 · DOI pending · <a href="https://we-do-care-global.github.io/agent-eval/" style="color:var(--gold)">Live page →</a></span></div>
</main>
<section id="about" class="section">
<h2 style="font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:2rem;color:#e8eaf2;margin-bottom:24px">About / Foundation</h2>
<p style="color:#e8eaf2;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.75">We Do Care Global began from one premise: autonomous AI needs governance before it scales. AgentGuard defines rules; Hybrid-RAG proves retrieval; Agent Eval proves measurement. Every release is archived via Zenodo; every citation links to ORCID. Built in Sarajevo. Open-source Apache-2.0.</p>
</section>
<section id="contact" class="section">
<h2 style="font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;font-size:2rem;color:#e8eaf2;margin-bottom:24px">Contact</h2>
<p style="color:#8b90a6"><strong>Emir Perla</strong> — AI Workflow &amp; Automation Engineer, Sarajevo.<br>Email: <a href="mailto:emirperla96@gmail.com" style="color:var(--gold)">emirperla96@gmail.com</a> · GitHub: <a href="https://github.com/emirperla96-lab" style="color:var(--gold)">emirperla96-lab</a> / <a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global" style="color:var(--gold)">we-do-care-global</a> · ORCID: <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8515-2727" style="color:var(--gold)">0009-0009-8515-2727</a></p>
</section>
<section id="admin" style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;padding:40px 24px;border-top:1px solid var(--gold);background:#0a0b10">
<h2 style="font-family:'Instrument Serif',Georgia,serif;color:var(--gold)">Admin / Internal</h2>
<p style="color:#8b90a6">Restricted to <code>emirperla96@gmail.com</code>.</p>
<form onsubmit="event.preventDefault();const e=document.getElementById('aemail').value.trim();if(e==='emirperla96@gmail.com'){document.getElementById('admintools').style.display='block';document.getElementById('aemail').value='';}else{alert('Access denied.')}">
<input id="aemail" type="email" placeholder="emirperla96@gmail.com" style="padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid #232635;background:#14161f;color:#e8eaf2;width:260px;max-width:100%" />
<button type="submit" style="padding:8px 16px;border-radius:6px;border:none;background:var(--gold);color:#1a1206;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer;margin-left:8px">Unlock</button>
</form>
<div id="admintools" style="display:none;margin-top:20px;padding:16px;background:#14161f;border:1px solid #232635;border-radius:10px">
<div style="max-height:320px;overflow-y:auto;padding:6px"><h4 style="color:var(--gold);margin:0 0 8px">All Projects — scrollable</h4><ul style="color:#e8eaf2;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.9;list-style:none;padding-left:0"><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/agentguard" style="color:#ff4d4d">AgentGuard (public)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/enterprise-hybrid-rag" style="color:#00b4d8">Enterprise Hybrid-RAG (public)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/agent-eval" style="color:#9d4edd">Agent Eval (public)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/atlantida-os" style="color:#8b90a6">atlantida-os (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/portfolio" style="color:#8b90a6">portfolio (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/we-do-care-media" style="color:#8b90a6">we-do-care-media (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/emirperla96-lab" style="color:#8b90a6">emirperla96-lab (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/wdc-music-pro" style="color:#8b90a6">wdc-music-pro (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/gemini-mcp-agentic-tools" style="color:#8b90a6">gemini-mcp-agentic-tools (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/hermes-edge-workstation" style="color:#8b90a6">hermes-edge-workstation (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/Atlantida-AI-GitHub-Portfolio-Orchestrator" style="color:#8b90a6">Atlantida-AI-Portfolio (private)</a></li><li><a href="https://github.com/we-do-care-global/browser-automation-scripts" style="color:#8b90a6">browser-automation-scripts (private)</a></li></ul></div><p style="color:#8b90a6;font-size:.9rem"><strong>Repos:</strong> agentguard ✓ · enterprise-hybrid-rag ✓ · agent-eval ✓</p><p style="color:#8b90a6;font-size:.9rem"><strong>Zenodo:</strong> linked (awaiting deposit)</p></div>
</section>
<footer class="footer">We Do Care Global — <a href="https://orcid.org/0009-0009-8515-2727" style="color:var(--gold)">ORCID 0009-0009-8515-2727</a> — Apache-2.0</footer>
</body>
</html>